   "role": "AGENT",
   "text": "All 4 failures are pre-existing environment issues (1Password SSH agent errors and test timeouts), not related to our changes. The test failures from the summary noted these same tests were already failing. Here's a summary of the implementation: **Changes made:** 1. **`cmd/entire/cli/lifecycle.go`** — Write `prompt.txt` to filesystem at turn start so it's available for mid-turn commits before SaveStep writes it to the shadow branch. 2. **`cmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_condensation.go`** — - Removed `turnPrompt` parameter from `extractSessionData` - Both `extractSessionData` and `extractSessionDataFromLiveTranscript` now read prompts from file sources (shadow branch tree → filesystem) with transcript extraction as fallback - Added `splitPromptContent()` and `readPromptsFromFilesystem()` helpers 3. **`cmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_hooks.go`** — - `finalizeAllTurnCheckpoints` uses full transcript extraction as primary source (since finalization replaces provisional data with the complete session transcript), with shadow branch and filesystem as fallbacks - Added `readPromptsFromShadowBranch()` helper 4. **`cmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit_test.go`** — Updated Gemini condensation tests to write `prompt.txt` before SaveStep calls, matching the new lifecycle flow."
  }
